  "id": "Lyo.FantasyFootball.Postgres",
  "name": "Lyo.FantasyFootball.Postgres",
  "area": "Plugins",
  "tagline": "PostgreSQL store for fantasy football chats and trades.",
  "description": "Schema `fantasy_football`. `AddPostgresFantasyFootballStore` and `AddPostgresFantasyFootballStoreFromConfiguration` register an `IDbContextFactory` and `IFantasyFootballStore`. Refresh upserts ESPN ids. A later league save does not delete members or teams that were omitted.",
  "features": [
    "`AddPostgresFantasyFootballStore` takes options, an action, or configuration.",
    "Unique keys are the ESPN league and season, member SWID, team id, topic id, message id, and transaction id.",
    "Roster replace updates a player still on the period and removes only players that left."
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Register the store",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "services.AddPostgresFantasyFootballStoreFromConfiguration(configuration);"
    }
  ],
